[
  {
    "id": 0,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "だあああ！！！\n終わらないよ、こんなの！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Arrrgh!!! This is never going to end!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 1,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なに？\u3000あんた逃げ出すの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What? Are you giving up already?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 2,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はあ？\u3000そんなこと言ってませんー！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Huh? I never said that!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 3,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんだ？\u3000誰かいるのか？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "What's that? Is someone there?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "警備鎧騎士",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Armored Guard"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 4,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "しまった！\u3000物陰に隠れましょう！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Oh no! Everyone, hide!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 5,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……確かに物音を聞いたはずだが",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I'm sure I heard something."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "警備鎧騎士",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Armored Guard"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 6,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "にゃーん",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Meooow..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 7,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんだ、ネコか",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just a cat, I guess."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "警備鎧騎士",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Armored Guard"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 8,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "危なかった……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "That was close..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 9,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "ははは！\u3000ミミ、かわいい声も出せるんだね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hahaha! Mimi, I didn't know you could sound that cute with your voice!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 10,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はあ？\u3000普段の声はなんだって言いたいのよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Excuse me? Are you saying my normal voice is lacking?!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 11,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "やはり誰かいるな！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "I knew there was someone there!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "警備鎧騎士",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Armored Guard"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 12,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "まずいよ、隠れなきゃ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "This is bad! We need to hide!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 13,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……隠れてないで出てこい",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...Come out already. I know you're hiding."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "警備鎧騎士",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Armored Guard"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 14,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "パオーン！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Paaaooo!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 15,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "なんだ、象か",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Just an elephant, huh."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "警備鎧騎士",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Armored Guard"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 16,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "くくく……パオーンって、あなた……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Pfft... 'Paaaooo'? You really..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 17,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いいだろ！\u3000騙せたんだから！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Hey, it worked, didn't it? He totally bought it!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 18,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "こら、静かに！\u3000見つかったら退学かもしれませんよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Quiet, both of you! We could get expelled if we're caught."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 19,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "はい……",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Fine..."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 20,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "でもさあ。よく考えたら割に合わなくない？\n最後には全部なくなっちゃうんでしょ、コレ？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "But seriously, thinking about it... is this even worth it? All of this is going to disappear in the end, right?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 21,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "徹夜で頑張ってんのにさ。\n退学のリスクだってあるのに",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We're staying up all night and risking expulsion for this."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 22,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "せっかくやるなら、完璧にしたいじゃない。\n中途半端なんて、私は嫌",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "If we're going to do something, we should do it perfectly. I can't stand leaving things half-finished."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 23,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "錬金術はね。想像を形にするものなの。\n今までそうやって、色んなものを作ってきたわ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alchemy is about turning imagination into reality. That's how I've created all sorts of things."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 24,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "プラフタさんの話を聞いて、最高の形が\n想像できちゃったの",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "After hearing Plachta's idea, I could perfectly visualize the final result."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 25,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "そしたらもう、形にするしかないじゃない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "And once I can see it, I have to make it happen."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ミミ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Mimi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 26,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……たしかに、そうかもね。\nその想いは、科学者だって同じだよ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...I suppose you're right. Scientists feel the same way."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 27,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "あはは、あたしはそこまで考えてなかったな",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Ahaha, I haven't been thinking that deeply about it at all!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 28,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "それなのにこんなことしてるの？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Then why are you even doing this?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 29,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "いいじゃん、それでも。楽しいし。\nこんなバカみたいなことしたことある？",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Because it's fun! When was the last time you did something this ridiculous?"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 30,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "きっと学生の間だけだよ。こんなことできるのは。\n大人になったら、立場も時間も許してくれない",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "We can only do stuff like this while we're students. Once we're adults, we won't have the position or time for it anymore."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ソフィー",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Sophie"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 31,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "……そうだね",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "...You've got a point there."
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 32,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "みんなー！\u3000元気が出るパイ、持ってきたよ！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Everyone! I brought some energy-boosting pies!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ロロナ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Rorona"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 33,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "よーし、それじゃあ最後までやるっきゃないよな！\nパイ食べて、もうひと頑張りするか！",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Alright! We might as well see this through to the end! Let's eat some pie and give it one more push!"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "ハイディ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Heidi"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 34,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（……いい雰囲気ですね。\n\u3000残る心配はただ１つ）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(The atmosphere is quite good now. There's just one more thing to worry about...)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  {
    "id": 35,
    "properties": {
      "999008199": {
        "text": "（間に合うかどうか）",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "(Whether we'll finish in time.)"
        }
      },
      "2072370017": {
        "text": "プラフタ",
        "localizations": {
          "en": "Plachta"
        }
      }
    }
  }
]